  "title": "refactor(core): node removal should notify the scheduler",
  "description": "This commit ensures that change detection runs when an `LView` is removed. Change detection is required because DOM nodes aren't actually removed until the animation engine flushes and this doesn't happen until the end of `detectChangesInternal` (`rendererFactory.end`).",
